    <h1>Ashwagandha 101: a root with a long history</h1><p class="dek">What Ashwagandha is, how it's traditionally used, and what to know before you try it.</p>
    <div class="ba-author"><img src="{{ 'mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="170" height="145" loading="eager"><span><b>Written by Team Veda</b><time datetime="2026-10-04">Oct 04, 2026</time></span></div>
